 solutions. With a friendly team of professionals, we are ready to partner with you at every stage of your project. We don't just follow trends—we build works that provide real value and tangible impact."},section2:{title:"Our Achievements",description:"Our projects are dominated by residential or housing categories and interior design for both residential and commercial spaces. Throughout 2024, LNA and Associates has completed more than 25 design projects across almost all of Indonesia."},section3:{title:"Discover Our Works in Video",description:"Explore our unique design works through inspiring videos. In every movement and perspective, we reveal the beauty and functionality of each space."},section4:{title:"Our Latest Projects",description:"Our focus is not just on design, but on creating meaningful spaces with real impact.",project:[{id:1,title:"Residential Home",description:"We are ready to bring your dream home to life with the best architectural designs that are elegant, functional, and fully personalized.",image:"https://media.lokanataaestetika.com/project-2.png",alt:"residential-project"},{id:2,title:"Interior Design",description:"Create spaces that reflect your lifestyle with elegant and characterful interior designs from our expert team.",image:"https://media.lokanataaestetika.com/project-1.png",alt:"interior-design-project"},{id:3,title:"Public Space",description:"We deliver public space designs that are functional, aesthetic, and invite interaction.",image:"https://media.lokanataaestetika.com/project-3.png",alt:"public-space-project"}]},section5:{title:"Our Featured projects",description:"Professional in designing, calculating, and realizing your building.",project:[{id:1,title:"Preliminary Design / Planning Concept",description:"The initial planning stage determines the overall design direction, including spatial concepts, mass composition, building orientation, and area estimation as a basis for decision making before entering the more detailed planning stage."},{id:2,title:"Budget Plan",description:"A document calculating the estimated costs required to complete a construction project from inception to completion."},{id:3,title:"Interior Design and 3D Visualizations",description:"Visualization of interior spaces in 2D and 3D designs to realistically depict layouts, colors, and atmospheres."},{id:4,title:"Detail Engineering Design and Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing",description:"DED and MEP documents present detailed technical planning covering mechanical, electrical, and plumbing systems as a reference for efficient and integrated building construction."},{id:5,title:"Structural Calculation",description:"Technical analysis to ensure the strength, stability, and safety of building structures."},{id:6,title:"Design Proposal",description:"This Design Proposal is an initial concept that clearly, inspiringly, and structuredly illustrates the creative idea and visual direction of the project."},{id:7,title:"Material Specifications",description:"A document outlining the type, quality, and standards of materials used in a project to ensure accuracy and final product quality."},{id:8,title:"Soft File Planning Documents",description:"All our planning is presented in neat, clear, and ready-to-use soft files."},{id:9,title:"A3 Color Print Out Results",description:"Exclusive A3 color print outs as a complement to your planning documents."}]},section6:{title:"25+ Companies and 120+ Individuals have utilized our projects",description:"Avoid bias, Optimize Architectural Design for Construction Efficiency."},section7:{title:"Our Construction Partners",description:"Trusted partners for quality, timely, and professional construction solutions."}},ET={section1:{title:"Background",description:`<strong>bhumiprojects</strong> was first launched in
 2018 to provide fresh and <em>distinctive</em>
 design options and perspectives, fostering a spirit of collaboration between talented young architects in
 Indonesia, stakeholders, and owners.`},section2:{title:"Our Vision",description:`Creating meaningful architecture with a seamless
 design approach as 
a harmony between humans, space,
 and the environment. Creating architecture that reflects the soul, character, and life of its users.`},section3:{title:"Our Mission",description:"Providing architectural solutions that reflect the character and needs of clients through designs that are simple, functional, and harmonious with the environment, by prioritizing collaborative processes with clients, partners, and stakeholders in every design stage."},section4:{title:"LNA Client List",subtitle:"Trusted by over 25 Indonesian Companies across various business sectors",description:"We believe that the achievements gained so far are based on client trust in us."},section5:{projects:["Design Ideas & Concepts","Architectural Planning","Interior Planning","Landscape Planning","Detail Engineering Design","Bill of Quantity","Basic 3D Visualization","360 Degree 3D Visualization"],titleLines:["architectural","design &","interior"]},section6:{projects:[{title:"Design Ideas & Concepts",highlight:"Every project begins with a deep understanding of the client's lifestyle, activity rhythm, and personal values.",description:"We do more than design buildings; we shape spatial narratives. The concept becomes the thread that connects architecture, interiors, and landscape into a complete and characterful spatial experience."},{title:"Architectural Planning",highlight:"Architecture is the foundation of quality of life.",description:"We design precise layouts, well-considered proportions, and massing that responds to its context. Every opening, light orientation, and circulation path is carefully considered to create long-term comfort and sustainable investment value."},{title:"Interior Planning",highlight:"Interior design is about how a space is felt.",description:"We curate materials, textures, lighting, and furniture details with a sophisticated and timeless approach. Each element is selected not only for appearance, but also for quality, durability, and relevance to the occupant's character."},{title:"Landscape Planning",highlight:"We design landscape as a smooth transition between architecture and nature.",description:"It brings shade, privacy, and a calming atmosphere within urban dynamics. In every landscape design, we consider plant character, architecture, and the surrounding environment so they work together harmoniously."},{title:"Detail Engineering Design",highlight:"Detail Engineering Design provides the technical guide that allows concepts to be built accurately.",description:"We prepare working drawings, construction details, structural references, and other technical requirements systematically so construction can proceed with clearer direction, better efficiency, and consistent design quality."},{title:"Bill of Quantity",highlight:"Clear cost planning helps clients make measured decisions.",description:"We prepare cost estimates based on work scope, materials, and construction requirements so every project stage has a realistic and transparent budget overview."},{title:"Basic 3D Visualization",highlight:"3D visualization helps clients understand the space before it is built.",description:"We provide visual representations that show form, atmosphere, material composition, and spatial proportions so the design direction can be understood more clearly."},{title:"360 Degree 3D Visualization",highlight:"360 visualization creates a more immersive spatial experience.",description:"Clients can explore the design from multiple perspectives, making it easier to evaluate spatial details, relationships between areas, and the overall design atmosphere."}]},section7:{projects:[{title:"Residential KRK/IRK",description:"We ensure every project stands on a strong legal foundation. KRK/IRK processing is handled professionally to confirm land-use suitability and compliance with urban planning regulations."},{title:"Residential PBG",description:"As a legally registered consultant, we assist clients through the Building Approval process."}],titleLines:["architectural","design &","interior"]},section8:{title:"Designing the future through spaces with character and impact.",description:"Our projects are dominated by residential and interior design categories, covering both residential and commercial spaces. Throughout 2025, LNA and Associates has completed more than 155 design projects across almost all of Indonesia.",stats:[{value:"+185",label:"Project Completed"},{value:"+6",label:"Year of Experience"},{value:"+12",label:"City"}]},section9:{titleLines:[["More than 120","people have","used","our projects."],["Trusted by","more than 20","Indonesian","companies."]],description:"We believe that our achievements so far are built on the trust our clients place in us."},section10:{title:"Simplify your journey with our one-stop solution projects. We bring together expertise, innovation, and reliable support to deliver complete solutions tailored to your unique requirements."}},_T={section1:{title:"Creating Spaces, Bringing Dreams to Life",description:"We are dedicated to creating spaces that are not only functional but also beautiful, realizing each client's unique vision."},section2:{title:"Our project Packages",description:"Professional in designing, calculating, and realizing your building.",priceList:[{id:1,title:"Architectural Design",description:"Building planning projects from concept to detailed architectural and structural work drawings.",phases:[{title:"Phase 1 - Basic Design",details:["Design Concept","Floor Plan Lt 1, Lt 2 etc.","Exterior Visualization (Facade)","Interior Visualization (for general illustration only, cannot be revised/detailed)","Design Specification"]},{title:"Phase 2 - Schematic and DED",details:["Schematic Drawings (Floor Plan, Elevations and Sections)","Detail Engineering Design (DED) Structure, Architecture and MEP"]},{title:"Phase 3 - Design Finalization",details:["Bill of Quantity (Architecture/Civil)","Final Design Document"]}]},{id:2,title:"Interior Design",description:"Interior space design projects that are aesthetic and functional, up to detailed furniture drawings.",phases:[{title:"Phase 1 - Basic Design",details:["Design Concept","Floor Plan Lt 1, Lt 2 etc.","Interior Visualization (mood, 3D view)","Furniture Specification (Finishing, Accessories and System)"]},{title:"Phase 2 - Design Finalization",details:["Interior Blow-up Drawings (Built-in and Custom Furniture)","Detail Engineering Design Drawings for Rooms and Furniture","Final Design Document"]}]},{id:3,title:"Architectural + Interior Bundling Design",description:"Integrated architectural and interior design projects in one comprehensive package.",phases:[{title:"Phase 1 - Basic Design",details:["Design Concept","Floor Plan Lt 1, Lt 2 etc.","Exterior Visualization (Facade)","Interior Visualization (min. 3 views)","Design Specification"]},{title:"Phase 2 - Schematic and DED",details:["Schematic Drawings (Floor Plan, Elevations and Sections)","Detail Engineering Design (DED) Structure, Architecture and MEP","Interior Blow-up Drawings (Built-in and Custom Furniture)","Furniture Specification (Finishing and Accessories)"]},{title:"Phase 3 - Design Finalization",details:["Bill of Quantity (Architecture/Civil)","Final Design Document"]}]}]},section3:[{id:1,title:"Contact Us",description:"Contact us and explain your needs to our Admin Team. The Admin will provide a link for filling out the request form and your profile."},{id:2,title:"Survey & Consultation",description:"Set up a survey schedule or initial discussion with our admin. Subsequently, our design team or surveyor will visit you."},{id:3,title:"project Offer",description:"After we have collected complete location data through a survey or initial discussion, our Admin will provide a project offer based on the data we have received."},{id:4,title:"Contract Signing",description:"If agreed, we will prepare a work agreement or contract for signing as a commitment from both parties to achieve your dream project."},{id:5,title:"Design Process",description:"Gotchaa! The designers and team can now proceed with the design process with you. Our Design Team will create a design group to facilitate brainstorming and design discussions."}],section4:[{id:1,title:"Personalized Design",description:"We create designs that reflect your needs, style, and personality."},{id:2,title:"Professional & Experienced Team",description:"Supported by an expert team that combines modern techniques and best practices in every project."},{id:3,title:"Timely & Quality Work",description:"We guarantee high-quality results and timely project completion."},{id:4,title:"Comprehensive projects",description:"From concept to construction supervision, we handle everything for you."}]},OT={message:"We use cookies to improve your experience on our website. By continuing to browse, you consent to the use of cookies in accordance with our terms and conditions",linkText:"our privacy policy.",accept:"Accept",decline:"Reject"},xT="We are a trusted and leading architectural design consulting firm, delivering innovative and high-quality solutions.",wT={title:"Our Projects",subtitle:"Explore our inspiring architectural design portfolio",description:"We are dedicated to creating functional, aesthetic, and sustainable spaces. Each project tells a unique story of our collaboration with clients.",showing:"Showing",projects:"projects",noProjects:"No projects found",ctaTitle:"Have a Dream Project?",ctaDescription:"Let's bring your architectural vision to life with our professional team. Consult your project needs with us now.",contactUs:"Contact Us",categories:{all:"All Projects",residential:"Residential",commercial:"Commercial",industrial:"Industrial",interior:"Interior",landscape:"Landscape"},projectDetail:{back:"Back",about:"About",projects:"Projects",gallery:"Project Gallery",aboutProject:"About Project",projectInfo:"Project Info",location:"Location",area:"Area",year:"Year",client:"Client",architects:"Architects",startSimilarProject:"Start Similar Project",relatedProjects:"Related Projects",interestedTitle:"Interested in This Project?",interestedDescription:"Discuss your project needs with our architectural team. We're ready to help bring your vision to life.",status:{completed:"Completed",ongoing:"Ongoing"}}},AT={welcome:bT,changeLanguage:ST,homePage:TT,aboutPage:ET,projectPage:_T,cookies:OT,footer:xT,projectsPage:wT},kT="Selamat data di LNA app",CT="Change Language",DT={section1:{title:"Desain bukan hanya soal tampilan, tetapi juga fungsi.",subtitle:"Mutu terbaik berawal dari perencanaan yang tepat.",description:"Kami menghadirkan solusi arsitektur yang unggul dan dapat diandalkan. Dengan tim profesional yang bersahabat, kami siap menjadi mitra dalam setiap tahap proyek Anda. Kami tidak sekadar mengikuti tren—kami membangun karya yang memberi nilai dan dampak nyata."},section2:{title:"Pencapaian Kami",description:"Proyek kami di dominasi kategori residential atau hunian dan interior desain baik hunian maupun komersial. Sepanjang tahun 2024 LNA and Associates telah menyelesaikan lebih dari 25 proyek desain hampir di seluruh indonesia."},section3:{title:"Cari Tahu Karya Kami Dalam Video",description:"Temukan karya karya desain unik kami melalui video yang menginspirasi. Dalam setiap gerakan dan sudut pandang, kami mengungkapkan keindahan dan fungsionalitas setiap ruang."},section4:{title:"Our Latest Projects",description:"Fokus kami bukan hanya pada desain, tapi menciptakan ruang yang bermakna dan berdampak nyata.",project:[{id:1,title:"Residential Home",description:"Kami siap mewujudkan rumah impian Anda dengan desain arsitektur terbaik yang elegan, fungsional, dan sepenuhnya personal.",image:"https://media.lokanataaestetika.com/project-2.png",alt:"residential-project"},{id:2,title:"Interior Design",description:"Ciptakan ruang yang mencerminkan gaya hidup Anda dengan desain interior elegan dan penuh karakter dari tim ahli kami",image:"https://media.lokanataaestetika.com/project-1.png",alt:"interior-design-project"},{id:3,title:"Public Space",description:"Kami menghadirkan desain ruang publik yang fungsional, estetis, dan mengundang interaksi.",image:"https://media.lokanataaestetika.com/project-3.png",alt:"public-space-project"}]},section5:{title:"Layanan Unggulan Kami",description:"Profesional dalam merancang, menghitung, dan mewujudkan bangunan Anda.",project:[{id:1,title:"Preliminary Design / Konsep Perencanaan",description:"Tahap awal perencanaan yang menetapkan arah desain secara keseluruhan, mencakup konsep tata ruang, gubahan massa, orientasi bangunan, dan estimasi luas sebagai dasar pengambilan keputusan sebelum masuk ke tahap perencanaan lebih detail."},{id:2,title:"Rencana anggaran biaya",description:"Dokumen perhitungan estimasi biaya yang dibutuhkan untuk menyelesaikan suatu proyek konstruksi dari awal hingga selesai."},{id:3,title:"Desain dan 3D Interior",description:"Visualisasi ruang interior dalam bentuk desain 2D dan 3D untuk menggambarkan tata letak, warna, dan suasana secara realistis."},{id:4,title:"Detail Engineering Design dan Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing",description:"Dokumen DED dan MEP menyajikan perencanaan teknis detail yang mencakup sistem mekanikal, elektrikal, dan perpipaan sebagai acuan pelaksanaan konstruksi bangunan yang efisien dan terintegrasi."},{id:5,title:"Perhitungan Stuktur",description:"Analisis teknis untuk memastikan kekuatan, kestabilan, dan keamanan struktur bangunan."},{id:6,title:"Proposal Design",description:"Proposal Design ini merupakan rancangan awal yang menggambarkan ide kreatif dan arah visual proyek secara jelas, inspiratif, dan terstruktur."},{id:7,title:"Spesifikasi Material",description:"Dokumen yang menjelaskan jenis, kualitas, dan standar material yang digunakan dalam suatu proyek untuk menjamin ketepatan dan mutu hasil akhir."},{id:8,title:"Soft File Dokumen Perencanaan",description:"Semua perencanaan kami disajikan dalam soft file yang rapi, jelas, dan siap digunakan."},{id:9,title:"Hasil Cetak Print Out A3 Berwarna",description:"Print out A3 berwarna eksklusif sebagai pelengkap dokumen perencanaan Anda."}]},section6:{title:"25+ Perusahaan dan 120+ Individu telah menggunakan jasa Kami",description:"Hindari bias, Mengoptimalkan Perancangan Arsitektur untuk Efisiensi Pembangunan."},section7:{title:"Partner Konstruksi Kami",description:"Mitra terpercaya untuk solusi konstruksi berkualitas, tepat waktu, dan profesional."}},RT={section1:{title:"Latar Belakang",description:`<strong>bhumiprojects</strong> dimulai pertama kali pada tahun
 2018 untuk memberikan pilihan dan perspektif desain yang segar dan
 <em> berkarakter </em>
  dengan semangat kolaborasi antara arsitek-arsitek muda berbakat di
 Indonesia, stakeholders dan owner.`},section2:{title:"Visi Kami",description:`Mewujudkan arsitektur yang
bermakna dengan pendekata
desain "seamless" sebagai
harmonisasi antara manusia, ruang,
dan lingkungan. Mewujudkan
arsitektur yang menjadi cerminan
jiwa, karakter, dan kehidupan
penggunanya`},section3:{title:"Misi Kami",description:"Memberikan solusi arsitektur yang merefleksikan karakter dan kebutuhan klien melalui desain yang sederhana, fungsional, dan harmonis dengan lingkungan, dengan mengedepankan proses kolaboratif bersama klien, mitra, dan pemangku kepentingan dalam setiap tahapan perancangan"},section4:{title:"Daftar Klien LNA",subtitle:"Dipercaya lebih dari 25 Perusahaan Indonesia di berbagai sektor bisnis",description:"Kami yakin bahwa pencapaian yang didapatkan selama ini atas dasar kepercayaan klien terhadap kami."},section5:{projects:["Ide & Konsep Desain","Perencanaan Arsitektur","Perencanaan Interior","Perencanaan Landscape","Detail Engineering Design","Rencana Anggaran Biaya","3D Visualization Basic","3D Visualization 360 Degree"],titleLines:["desain","arsitektur &","interior"]},section6:{projects:[{title:"Ide & Konsep Desain",highlight:"Setiap proyek kami dimulai dari pemahaman mendalam terhadap gaya hidup, ritme aktivitas, dan nilai personal klien.",description:"Kami tidak sekadar merancang bangunan, tetapi menyusun narasi ruang. Konsep yang lahir menjadi benang merah yang menyatukan arsitektur, interior, hingga lanskap, menciptakan pengalaman spasial yang utuh dan berkarakter."},{title:"Perencanaan Arsitektur",highlight:"Arsitektur adalah fondasi kualitas hidup.",description:"Kami merancang tata ruang yang presisi, proporsi yang matang, serta komposisi massa yang kontekstual terhadap lingkungan. Setiap bukaan, orientasi cahaya, dan sirkulasi dipertimbangkan matang untuk menciptakan kenyamanan jangka panjang sekaligus nilai investasi yang berkelanjutan."},{title:"Perencanaan Interior",highlight:"Interior adalah tentang bagaimana ruang dirasakan.",description:"Kami mengkurasi material, tekstur, pencahayaan, dan detail furnitur dengan pendekatan yang sophisticated dan timeless. Setiap elemen dipilih bukan hanya karena tampilannya, tetapi karena kualitas, durabilitas, dan relevansinya terhadap karakter penghuni."},{title:"Perencanaan Landscape",highlight:"Lanskap kami rancang sebagai transisi halus antara arsitektur dan alam.",description:"Menghadirkan keteduhan, privasi, dan suasana yang menenangkan di tengah dinamika kota. Dalam setiap rancangan landscape, kami selalu memperhatikan karakter tanaman, arsitektur dan lingkungan agar terpadu harmonis."},{title:"Detail Engineering Design",highlight:"Detail Engineering Design menjadi panduan teknis agar konsep dapat dibangun dengan akurat.",description:"Kami menyusun gambar kerja, detail konstruksi, struktur, dan kebutuhan teknis lain secara sistematis agar proses pelaksanaan lebih terarah, efisien, dan sesuai standar kualitas desain."},{title:"Rencana Anggaran Biaya",highlight:"Perencanaan biaya yang jelas membantu klien mengambil keputusan dengan lebih terukur.",description:"Kami menyusun estimasi biaya berdasarkan lingkup pekerjaan, material, dan kebutuhan konstruksi sehingga setiap tahap proyek memiliki gambaran anggaran yang realistis dan transparan."},{title:"3D Visualization Basic",highlight:"Visualisasi 3D membantu klien membaca ruang sebelum dibangun.",description:"Kami menghadirkan representasi visual yang memperlihatkan bentuk, suasana, komposisi material, dan proporsi ruang agar arah desain dapat dipahami dengan lebih jelas."},{title:"3D Visualization 360",highlight:"Visualisasi 360 memberi pengalaman ruang yang lebih imersif.",description:"Klien dapat mengeksplorasi desain dari berbagai sudut pandang sehingga detail ruang, hubungan antar area, dan atmosfer desain dapat dievaluasi dengan lebih menyeluruh."}]},section7:{projects:[{title:"KRK/IRK Hunian",description:"Kami memastikan setiap proyek berdiri di atas fondasi legalitas yang kuat. Pengurusan KRK/IRK dilakukan secara profesional untuk memastikan kesesuaian peruntukan lahan dan ketentuan tata kota."},{title:"PBG Hunian",description:"Sebagai konsultan berbadan hukum, kami mendampingi proses pengurusan Persetujuan Bangunan."}],titleLines:["desain","arsitektur &","interior"]},section8:{title:"Merancang masa depan melalui ruang yang berkarakter dan berdampak.",description:"Proyek kami didominasi kategori residential atau hunian dan interior desain, baik hunian maupun komersial. Sepanjang tahun 2025 LNA and Associates telah menyelesaikan lebih dari 155 proyek desain hampir di seluruh Indonesia.",stats:[{value:"+185",label:"Project Completed"},{value:"+6",label:"Year of Experience"},{value:"+12",label:"City"}]},section9:{titleLines:[["Lebih dari 120","orang telah","menggunakan","layanan kami."],["Dipercaya lebih","dari 20","Perusahaan","Indonesia."]],description:"Kami yakin bahwa pencapaian yang didapatkan selama ini atas dasar kepercayaan klien terhadap kami."},section10:{title:"Solusi terpadu untuk seluruh kebutuhan Anda. Mulai dari konsultasi, perencanaan, desain, pengembangan, hingga implementasi dan dukungan berkelanjutan, kami menghadirkan layanan profesional dalam satu tempat untuk membantu mewujudkan tujuan Anda secara efektif dan efisien."}},LT={section1:{title:"Menciptakan Ruang, Menghidupkan Impian",description:"Kami berdedikasi untuk menciptakan ruang yang tidak hanya fungsional tetapi juga indah, menghadirkan visi unik setiap klien."},section2:{title:"Paket Layanan Kami",description:"Profesional dalam merancang, menghitung, dan mewujudkan bangunan Anda.",priceList:[{id:1,title:"Desain Arsitektur",description:"Layanan perencanaan bangunan dari konsep hingga gambar kerja detail arsitektur dan struktur.",phases:[{title:"Fase 1 - Basic Design",details:["Konsep Desain","Denah Rencana Lt 1, Lt 2 dst","Visualisasi Eksterior (Fasad)","Visualisasi Interior (sebagai gambaran umum saja, tidak dapat direvisi/detailkan)","Spesifikasi Desain"]},{title:"Fase 2 - Skematik dan DED",details:["Gambar Skematik (Denah, Tampak dan Potongan)","Detail Engineering Design (DED) Struktur, Arsitektur dan MEP"]},{title:"Fase 3 - Finalisasi Desain",details:["Rincian Anggaran Biaya (Arsitektur/Sipil)","Dokumen Final Desain"]}]},{id:2,title:"Desain Interior",description:"Layanan perancangan interior ruang yang estetis dan fungsional hingga gambar detail furniture.",phases:[{title:"Fase 1 - Basic Design",details:["Konsep Desain","Denah Rencana Lt 1, Lt 2 dst","Visualisasi Interior (mood, 3D view)","Spesifikasi Furniture (Finishing, Aksesoris dan Sistem)"]},{title:"Fase 2 - Finalisasi Desain",details:["Gambar Blowup Interior (Furniture Melekat dan Custom)","Gambar Kerja Detail Engineering Design Ruangan dan Furniture","Dokumen Final Desain"]}]},{id:3,title:"Desain Bundling Arsitektur + Interior",description:"Layanan terintegrasi desain arsitektur dan interior dalam satu paket komprehensif.",phases:[{title:"Fase 1 - Basic Design",details:["Konsep Desain","Denah Rencana Lt 1, Lt 2 dst","Visualisasi Eksterior (Fasad)","Visualisasi Interior (min. 3 view)","Spesifikasi Desain"]},{title:"Fase 2 - Skematik dan DED",details:["Gambar Skematik (Denah, Tampak dan Potongan)","Detail Engineering Design (DED) Struktur, Arsitektur dan MEP","Gambar Blowup Interior (Furniture Melekat dan Custom)","Spesifikasi Furniture (Finishing dan Aksesoris)"]},{title:"Fase 3 - Finalisasi Desain",details:["Rincian Anggaran Biaya (Arsitektur/Sipil)","Dokumen Final Desain"]}]}]},section3:[{id:1,title:"Hubungi Kami",description:"Hubungi kami melalui dan jelaskan mengenai kebutuhan Anda kepada Tim Admin kami. Admin akan memberikan link untuk pengisian form request dan profil anda."},{id:2,title:"Survey & Konsultasi",description:"Set up jadwal survey atau diskusi awal bersama admin kami. Selanjutnya tim desainer atau surveyor kami akan mengunjungi anda."},{id:3,title:"Penawaran Jasa",description:"Setelah kami mengumpulkan kelengkapan data lokasi melalui survey atau diskusi awal. Admin kami akan memberikan penawaran jasa kepada anda berdasarkan data yang sudah kami terima."},{id:4,title:"Penandatangan Kontrak",description:"Apabila disetujui, kami akan menyiapkan surat perjanjian kerja atau kontrak untuk ditandatangani sebagai komitmen kedua belah pihak untuk mencapai proyek impian anda."},{id:5,title:"Proses Desain",description:"Gotchaa! Desainer dan tim sudah bisa melakukan proses desain bersama anda. Tim Desainer kami akan membuatkan group desain untuk memudahkan proses brainstorming dan diskusi desain."}],section4:[{id:1,title:"Desain yang Dipersonalisasi",description:"Kami menciptakan desain yang mencerminkan kebutuhan, gaya, dan kepribadian Anda."},{id:2,title:"Tim Profesional & Berpengalaman",description:"Didukung tim ahli yang memadukan teknik modern dan praktik terbaik dalam setiap proyek."},{id:3,title:"Tepat Waktu & Berkualitas",description:"Kami menjamin hasil berkualitas tinggi dan penyelesaian proyek tepat waktu."},{id:4,title:"Layanan Komprehensif",description:"Mulai dari konsep hingga pengawasan konstruksi, kami tangani semuanya untuk Anda."}]},MT={message:"Kami menggunakan cookies untuk meningkatkan pengalaman Anda di situs web kami. Dengan melanjutkan penjelajahan, Anda menyetujui penggunaan cookies sesuai dengan",linkText:"kebijakan privasi kami.",accept:"Terima",decline:"Tolak"},zT="Kami adalah perusahaan konsultan desain arsitektur yang terpercaya dan terkemuka,dalam menyajikan solusi inovatif dan berkualitas tinggi.",jT={title:"Proyek Kami",subtitle:"Jelajahi portofolio desain arsitektur kami yang menginspirasi",description:"Kami berdedikasi untuk menciptakan ruang yang fungsional, estetis, dan berkelanjutan. Setiap proyek menceritakan kisah unik tentang kolaborasi kami dengan klien.",showing:"Menampilkan",projects:"proyek",noProjects:"Tidak ada proyek ditemukan",ctaTitle:"Punya Proyek Impian?",ctaDescription:"Mari wujudkan visi arsitektur Anda bersama tim profesional kami. Konsultasikan kebutuhan proyek Anda sekarang.",contactUs:"Hubungi Kami",categories:{all:"Semua Proyek",residential:"Perumahan",commercial:"Komersial",industrial:"Industri",interior:"Interior",landscape:"Lanskap"},projectDetail:{back:"Kembali",about:"Beranda",projects:"Proyek",gallery:"Galeri Proyek",aboutProject:"Tentang Proyek",projectInfo:"Informasi Proyek",location:"Lokasi",area:"Luas Area",year:"Tahun",client:"Klien",architects:"Arsitek",startSimilarProject:"Mulai Proyek Serupa",relatedProjects:"Proyek Terkait",interestedTitle:"Tertarik dengan Proyek Ini?",interestedDescription:"Diskusikan kebutuhan proyek Anda dengan tim arsitek kami. Kami siap membantu mewujudkan visi Anda.",status:{completed:"Selesai",ongoing:"Sedang Berjalan"}}},NT={welcome:kT,changeLanguage:CT,homePage:DT,aboutPage:RT,projectPage:LT,cookies:MT,footer:zT,projectsPage:jT};ut.use(Fm).use(U2).init({fallbackLng:"en",debug:!0,interpolation:{escapeValue:!1},resources:{en:{translation:AT},id:{translation:NT}},detection:{order:["queryString","cookie","localStorage","navigator","htmlTag"],caches:["localStorage"]},compatibilityJSON:"v3"});const UT={width:"auto",maxWidth:"400px",borderRadius:"8px",padding:"16px"};D0.createRoot(document.getElementById("root")).render(ue.jsxs(Nm,{children:[ue.jsx(HS,{position:"top-right",autoClose:5e3,hideProgressBar:!1,newestOnTop:!1,closeOnClick:!0,rtl:!1,pauseOnFocusLoss:!0,draggable:!0,pauseOnHover:!0,style:UT}),ue.jsx(P1,{children:ue.jsx(om,{children:ue.jsx(Ut,{path:"/*",element:ue.jsx(nS,{})})})})]}));export{QT as F,Zt as G,ZT as H,pm as L,oe as R,Ab as S,cn as a,YT as b,Bn as c,GT as d,VT as e,qT as f,s1 as g,Bi as h,A0 as i,ue as j,kb as k,Yc as l,BT as m,KT as n,PT as o,XT as p,$T as q,D as r,K2 as u,De as y};
